  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA 2024- Sudan GBV/CP &amp; SRHR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing GBV response and prevention for IDPs and host committees in Gadarif and Kordofan (North and South) States, Sudan_x000d_
_x000d_
This three-month project will be implemented in Kassala, Gedarif, North Kordofan and South Kordofan States where Plan International Sudan has operational presence. The specific localities include Kassala and Garab Kassala (Kassala State), Algellabat Algharbyia and Baladyat Algedaref (Gedarif State), Shaikan (North Kordofan) and Kadugli (South Kordofan). The project focuses on GBV interventions with integration of FGM. It includes integrated GBV interventions and response activities with specific focus on adolescents girls as well as other community members IDPs/Refugees gathering sites as well as host communities in the target States.</narrative>
  </description>
